  "question": {
    "text": "Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> be two relations defined as follows :<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8712;</mo><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>:</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>Q</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8712;</mo><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>:</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8713;</mo><mi>Q</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>, where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Q</mi></math> is the set of all rational numbers, then</p>"
  },
